WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
ResearchDesk runs locally on the target Mac. Original annual filings and source-linked financial facts.

00:05.000 --> 00:19.000
A validated financial request executes on the server. The model does not authorize or perform the calculation.

00:19.000 --> 00:26.000
Inspect original evidence, actual fiscal dates, formula inputs and complete source identifiers.

00:26.000 --> 00:40.000
Change an explicit valuation assumption. The server recalculates and exports the actual scenario PDF.

00:40.000 --> 01:16.000
A separate local model explains disclosures. Generated claims and interpretations carry inspectable source references.

01:16.000 --> 01:30.000
Evaluation history and limitations remain visible. Human semantic review is pending; source identity alone is not support.
